WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:14.487
Mark: Do you think Mr. Lenny is in danger?

2
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.293
Coby: I'm not sure.

3
00:00:17.294 --> 00:00:21.094
Hey . . . Maybe we should spy on him!

4
00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:23.053
Mark: Spy on him?

5
00:00:23.054 --> 00:00:25.422
What for?

6
00:00:25.423 --> 00:00:28.695
Coby: To see if he needs help.

7
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:34.766
Mark: Mr. Lenny might need help, but not from kids.

8
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:39.405
Mark: And remember what your mom said?

9
00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:44.427
Coby: Yes. She said I can use my spy kit to help people.

10
00:00:44.428 --> 00:00:50.380
Coby: And this would be helping someone—Mr. Lenny.

11
00:00:50.381 --> 00:00:53.476
Mark: I don't know, Coby.

12
00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:54.987
Coby: Come on, Mark.

13
00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.792
Let's just spy on him for a little while.

14
00:00:58.793 --> 00:01:02.573
Coby: To make sure that he's not in danger.

15
00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:04.821
Mark: Okay, fine.

16
00:01:04.822 --> 00:01:24.109
But I don't think this is a good idea . . .

17
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:27.268
Coby: School's over.

18
00:01:27.269 --> 00:01:40.060
So Mr. Lenny should be going home soon.

19
00:01:40.061 --> 00:01:42.942
Mark: He doesn't look ready to go home.

20
00:01:42.943 --> 00:01:55.119
Mark: He's still picking up trash.

21
00:01:55.120 --> 00:02:00.811
Coby: Now he's helping that lady cross the street.

22
00:02:00.812 --> 00:02:03.782
Mark: And talking to those kids.

23
00:02:03.783 --> 00:02:06.218
This is getting boring, Coby.

24
00:02:06.219 --> 00:02:08.933
Mark: I don't think Mr. Lenny needs our—

25
00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:21.050
Coby: Shh. He's finally locking the doors!

26
00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:23.075
Mark: Where's he going?

27
00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:24.554
Coby: I'm not sure.

28
00:02:24.555 --> 00:02:33.802
Let's follow him!

29
00:02:33.803 --> 00:02:38.458
Mark: I think he's heading for the bank.

30
00:02:38.459 --> 00:02:42.545
Coby: Oh no! Remember what the note said?

31
00:02:42.546 --> 00:02:51.254
Mark: Yep. It said, "Bring my money . . . Or else!"

32
00:02:51.255 --> 00:03:07.947
Mark: Uh-oh! Here comes Mr. Lenny . . .

33
00:03:07.948 --> 00:03:10.582
Coby: With all his money!
